{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03252","headline":"冬宵引赠司马承祯 · 宋之问","name":"冬宵引赠司马承祯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河有冰兮山有雪，北户墐兮行人绝。\n独坐山中兮对松月，怀美人兮屡盈缺。\n明月的的寒潭中，青松幽幽吟劲风。\n此情不向俗人说，爱而不见恨无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}